# ai-sec-labs — upstream sources fetched at build time.
#
# Format (tab-separated):  name <TAB> url <TAB> ref <TAB> license
#
# Only sources that are NOT vendored appear here. The lab host in host/ is a
# vendored, de-branded derivative of LLMVault (MIT) — see ATTRIBUTION.md — and
# therefore needs no fetch.
#
# `ref` MUST be a full 40-char commit SHA for anything you depend on.

